Which Framework Should You Learn?

| Goal                 | Recommended Framework     |
| -------------------- | ------------------------- |
| Learn Multi-Agent AI | AutoGen                   |
| Enterprise AI        | Microsoft Agent Framework |
| AI Teams             | CrewAI                    |
| Stateful Workflows   | LangGraph                 |
| RAG Applications     | LlamaIndex + LangChain    |
| AI Chatbots          | LangChain                 |
| AI Coding Assistant  | AutoGen                   |
| AI Travel Planner    | CrewAI / LangGraph        |
| AI Research          | DSPy                      |
| No-Code AI Apps      | Flowise / Dify            |

========

These are among the most widely used and actively developed frameworks today. Each has a different focus—some excel at multi-agent orchestration,
others at RAG, enterprise integration, or visual workflow building. Choosing the right one depends on the type of AI application you want to build.

